  "notes": "Warm parchment canvas (#ece8de) with off-white cards and a deep teal header and primary colour. Per-result match chips show which query terms each location satisfies: green check = met, red strike-through = missed, amber = partial. Match-quality pills read MEETS ALL / GOOD / PARTIAL; in Find-similar mode they read '74% ALIKE'. Status lines use coloured dots (Owner active/unresponsive, days blocked). The filter row's 'Hidden:' chips count how many results each filter hides and bring them back with one click. The free text is parsed into 'Understood as' chips that can be switched off to widen the search. Live behaviour not in the capture: the title opens a right-side detail drawer with a photo carousel and fit-to-request stat tiles; Shortlist adds the item to the Candidate set and shows a dark toast; More filters opens a second facet row; Map shows drive-time rings. Thumbnails are flat illustrations, not photos."
}
